text:
Amenities; 
We stayed here for two nights for a wedding in the standard cabin. The room itself is very clean and well designed. I was not deterred by the fact that is was quite small, having two very comfortable sitting chairs and a comfortable bed. The only issue I had with the room was the common wall was very thin. I was able to hear the people in the next room snoring and talking during the night. If you plan on using the bed for anything other than sleeping then make sure you do it on the sly, as it would be very obvious to the people in the next room. 
The rooms are situated just out of town in a very well maintained and quiet garden

Service;
Outstanding service. The people running these cabins appear to live on site. They were very helpful and friendly and anything I asked of them was not a problem.
